  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="7faf036e-bdab-58de-a1df-cf76e6cd9222" activityNameId="5b858f50-3825-5674-ad2f-565132a24526" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Grain drying, high temperature</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Grain drying, high temperature
The functional unit is kg water evaporated. This module should be used when evaluating drying of cereals and maize grains used as feedstuff.;
UUID: 3785727e-28d8-3956-82f4-1e54e868677d
The inventory takes into account the energy demand (supplied by burning light fuel oil and consumption of electricity) for evaporating 1 kg of water, when drying grain at high temperature (95-100°C). Also included in the inventory is the infrastructure (building and machinery). Inventoried outputs are heat waste and air emissions from combustion. Not included are waste and other air emissions (like dust). Production of the wet educt and utilisation of the dried product, are not included.
Location: The inventories are based on indications made by drying plants in Switzerland and values given in international references (Western Europe).
Technology: The inventories are based on common grain drying plants.
Time period: Time of publication in literature and annual reports. Most publications between 2001 and 2002.
Production volume: Values representative for CH  plants, part of it are single plant measurements.
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: Values are based partially on non verified measurements, on expert estimations and on international references.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3785727e-28d8-3956-82f4-1e54e868677d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
